          Tecnología Clínica Diferencial
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface mt-space-xs max-w-xl">
          La suite médica que comprende el paladar y la realidad económica de Honduras
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs bg-surface-container-lowest px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full shadow-sm">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
        <span class="text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Validado con tablas INCAP y TCA-HN</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-md">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/20 text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
